Design a Tiny URL System

Requirements:

1. Generate Short URL
2. Redirect to original URL
3. We need to have each and every tiny url unique
4. We need to be able to track how many times a tiny url is used


Core Entities:

1. TinyURL Service
 -> It generates the tiny url
2. TinyURL Repository
-> It stores the mapping between long url and tiny url
3. TinyURL Controller
-> It creates a tiny url for a long url and returns the tiny url